#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QLabel, lblCustomLabel)
#. +> trunk
#: folderviewDisplayConfig.ui:24
msgid "Label:"
msgstr "Beteker:"

#. i18n: ectx: property (whatsThis), widget (KLineEdit, labelEdit)
#. +> trunk
#: folderviewDisplayConfig.ui:39
msgid ""
"This edit field contains the label which is shown at the top of the applet.\n"
"\n"
"By default it contains the name of the place being shown in the applet, but if you prefer to have a custom label you can enter it here."
msgstr ""
"Dit Feld bargt den Beteker, de baven in't Lüttprogramm wiest warrt.\n"
"\n"
"Standardwies bargt dat de Steed, de dat Lüttprogramm wiest, man wenn Du lever en topasst Beteker bruken wullt, kannst Du em hier angeven."

#. i18n: ectx: property (title), widget (QGroupBox, groupBox_2)
#. +> trunk
#: folderviewDisplayConfig.ui:48
msgid "Icon Settings"
msgstr "Lüttbild-Instellen"

#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QLabel, label_4)
#. +> trunk
#: folderviewDisplayConfig.ui:57
msgid "Icon size:"
msgstr "Lüttbildgrött:"

#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QLabel, label_5)
#. +> trunk
#: folderviewDisplayConfig.ui:85
msgid "Small"
msgstr "Lütt"

#. i18n: ectx: property (whatsThis), widget (QSlider, sizeSlider)
#. +> trunk
#: folderviewDisplayConfig.ui:95
msgid "Use this slider to increase or decrease the size of the icons in the view."
msgstr "Mit dissen Schuver kannst Du de Lüttbiller binnen de Ansicht lütter un grötter maken."

#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QLabel, label_6)
#. +> trunk
#: folderviewDisplayConfig.ui:117
msgid "Large"
msgstr "Groot"

#. i18n: ectx: property (whatsThis), widget (QCheckBox, showPreviews)
#. +> trunk
#: folderviewDisplayConfig.ui:144
msgid "Check this option if you want to see previews of the file contents in the icons."
msgstr "Maak dit an, wenn Du Vöransichten vun den Dateiinholt as Lüttbiller bruken wullt."

#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QCheckBox, showPreviews)
#. +> trunk
#: folderviewDisplayConfig.ui:147
msgid "Show previews"
msgstr "Vöransichten wiesen"

#. i18n: ectx: property (whatsThis), widget (QPushButton, previewsAdvanced)
#. +> trunk
#: folderviewDisplayConfig.ui:154
msgid "Click this button to choose for which types of files previews will be shown."
msgstr "Mit dissen Knoop laat sik de Dateitypen fastleggen, för de Vöransichten wiest warrt."

#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QPushButton, previewsAdvanced)
#. +> trunk
#: folderviewDisplayConfig.ui:157
msgid "Advanced Options"
msgstr "Verwiedert Optschonen"

#. i18n: ectx: property (title), widget (QGroupBox, groupBox_3)
#. +> trunk
#: folderviewDisplayConfig.ui:182
msgid "Text Settings"
msgstr "Text-Instellen"

#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QLabel, label_2)
#. +> trunk
#: folderviewDisplayConfig.ui:191
msgid "Text color:"
msgstr "Textklöör:"

#. i18n: ectx: property (whatsThis), widget (KColorButton, colorButton)
#. +> trunk
#: folderviewDisplayConfig.ui:206
msgid "Click this button to choose the color which is used for the text labels in the view."
msgstr "Mit dissen Knoop kannst Du de Textklöör för disse Ansicht fastleggen."

#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QLabel, label_3)
#. +> trunk
#: folderviewDisplayConfig.ui:231
msgid "Number of lines:"
msgstr "Tall vun Regen:"

#. i18n: ectx: property (whatsThis), widget (QSpinBox, numLinesEdit)
#. +> trunk
#: folderviewDisplayConfig.ui:252
msgid "Use this control to choose how many lines of text will be shown below the icons."
msgstr "Hier kannst Du Tall vun Textregen nerrn de Lüttbiller fastleggen."

#. i18n: ectx: property (whatsThis), widget (QCheckBox, drawShadows)
#. +> trunk
#: folderviewDisplayConfig.ui:284
msgid ""
"<html><body>"
"<p>Check this option if you want the text labels to cast a shadow on the background.</p>"
"\n"
"<p></p>"
"\n"
"<p>Shadows help make the text easier to read by making it stand out more from the background.</p>"
"\n"
"<p></p>"
"\n"
"<p><i>Note that with dark text colors, this option will cause the text to glow with a bright halo, instead of casting a shadow.</i></p>"
"</body></html>"
msgstr ""
"<html><body>"
"<p>Maak dit an, wenn de Text Schaddens op den Achtergrund hebben schall.</p>"
"\n"
"<p></p>"
"\n"
"<p>Mit Schaddens lett sik de Text lichter lesen, he stickt denn beter vun den Achtergrund af.</p>"
"\n"
"<p></p>"
"\n"
"<p><i>Beacht bitte: Bi düüster Textklören kriggt de Text en hell Ümreet ansteed en Schadden.</i></p>"
"</body></html>"

#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QCheckBox, drawShadows)
#. +> trunk
#: folderviewDisplayConfig.ui:287
msgid "Show text shadows"
msgstr "Textschaddens wiesen"

#. i18n: ectx: property (title), widget (QGroupBox, groupBox)
#. +> trunk
#: folderviewDisplayConfig.ui:297
msgid "Icon Arrangement"
msgstr "Lüttbild-Anornen"

#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QLabel, flowLabel)
#. +> trunk
#: folderviewDisplayConfig.ui:310
msgid "Arrange icons:"
msgstr "Lüttbiller utrichten:"

#. i18n: ectx: property (whatsThis), widget (QComboBox, flowCombo)
#. +> trunk
#: folderviewDisplayConfig.ui:323
msgid "Use this control to choose if you want the icons to be arranged top to bottom starting on the left side of the view, or arranged left to right starting at the top of the view."
msgstr "Hier kannst Du fastleggen, wodennig Du de Lüttbiller utrichten wullt: vun baven na nerrn, links anfungen, oder vun links na rechts, baven anfungen."

#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QLabel, label)
#. +> trunk
#: folderviewDisplayConfig.ui:330
msgid "Sort icons:"
msgstr "Lüttbiller sorteren:"

#. i18n: ectx: property (whatsThis), widget (QComboBox, sortCombo)
#. +> trunk
#: folderviewDisplayConfig.ui:343
msgid "Use this control to choose the criteria by which the icons will be sorted in the view."
msgstr "Hier kannst Du de Egenschap utsöken, na de Du de Lüttbiller binnen de Ansicht sorteren wullt."

#. i18n: ectx: property (whatsThis), widget (QCheckBox, alignToGrid)
#. +> trunk
#: folderviewDisplayConfig.ui:369
msgid ""
"Check this option if you want the icons to be arranged in a grid.\n"
"\n"
"When this option is checked, icons will automatically snap to the nearest grid cell when you move them around in the view."
msgstr ""
"Maak dit an, wenn Du de Lüttbiller na en Gadder utrichten wullt.\n"
"\n"
"Is dit anmaakt, backt Lüttbiller bi't Bewegen binnen de Ansicht automaatsch an't neegste Gadderkrüüz."

#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QCheckBox, alignToGrid)
#. +> trunk
#: folderviewDisplayConfig.ui:372
msgid "Align icons in a grid"
msgstr "Na't Gadder utrichten"

#. i18n: ectx: property (whatsThis), widget (QCheckBox, lockInPlace)
#. +> trunk
#: folderviewDisplayConfig.ui:381
msgid ""
"Check this option if you do not want the icons to be moveable in the view.\n"
"\n"
"This option is useful if you want to avoid accidentally moving the icons while interacting with them."
msgstr ""
"Maak dit an, wenn Du nich wullt, dat sik de Lüttbiller binnen de Ansicht bewegen laat.\n"
"\n"
"Disse Optschoon is goot, wenn Du dat verhöden wullt, Du beweegst de Lüttbiller ahn Wüllen."

#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QCheckBox, lockInPlace)
#. +> trunk
#: folderviewDisplayConfig.ui:384
msgid "Lock icons in place"
msgstr "Lüttbiller fastsetten"

#. i18n: ectx: property (text), item, widget (QComboBox, filterType)
#. +> trunk
#: folderviewFilterConfig.ui:29
msgid "Show All Files"
msgstr "All Dateien wiesen"

#. i18n: ectx: property (text), item, widget (QComboBox, filterType)
#. +> trunk
